              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "shelbe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious. I made the recipe as written and found it a little too sweet so 2nd batch tonight I eliminated the grenadine and added a dash of lime juice. YUMMMMMY! Great way to top off the night :)"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Verena1219"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this and found it to be much too sweet for my taste. I eliminated the grenadine and cut the Cointreau to 1 oz and added an ounce to the vodka and it was *perfect*! EVERYONE just loves this and it has become my signature drink. I do use POM for the pomegranate juice and I think that makes a big difference.",
            "datePublished": "2011-12-31T10:59:16.920Z"
          },
          {
