              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Yoly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "After reading the reviews that this martini was too sweet, I tasted it without the grenadine. I then added the grenadine and tasted it again. It is much better without it and next time I will leave it out completely.",
            "datePublished": "2020-06-06T23:52:27.980Z"
